# Functions positively associated with integral transforms

**Authors:** Alexander Koldobsky

## Summary
We introduce the class of functions positively associated with a linear operator. We describe these classes for several integral operators including the $q$-cosine transform and the spherical Radon transform. We show that positively associated functions control the comparison problem for linear operators generalizing the Busemann-Petty problem for convex bodies.


